  "post_content": "<p><img alt=\"\" src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/2016/02/IMG_0270.jpg\" style=\"width: 480px; height: 320px;\" /></p>\n<p>(107 fotos en total) El fin de semana ha sido muy intenso para Patricia Campos Dom&eacute;nech, al recibir la noche del viernes el Seny Onder del Ateneo Cultural y Mercantil (57 fotos), y</p>\n<p><img alt=\"\" src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/2016/02/IMG_0834.jpg\" style=\"width: 480px; height: 320px;\" /></p>\n<p>la ma&ntilde;ana del s&aacute;bado la distinci&oacute;n del m&eacute;rito a la solidaridad de la Diputaci&oacute;n Provincial de Castell&oacute;n (50 fotos).</p>\n<p></p>\n<div class=\"galeria-ngg\" style=\"display:flex;flex-wrap:wrap;gap:8px;\"><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/patriciacampossenyonderdistinciosolidaritat/img_0189.jpg\" alt=\"img_0189\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/patriciacampossenyonderdistinciosolidaritat/img_0191.jpg\" alt=\"img_0191\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/patriciacampossenyonderdistinciosolidaritat/img_0195.jpg\" alt=\"img_0195\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/patriciacampossenyonderdistinciosolidaritat/img_0196.jpg\" alt=\"img_0196\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/patriciacampossenyonderdistinciosolidaritat/img_0199.jpg\" alt=\"img_0199\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/patriciacampossenyonderdistinciosolidaritat/img_0200.jpg\" alt=\"img_0200\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/patriciacampossenyonderdistinciosolidaritat/img_0201.jpg\" alt=\"img_0201\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:aut